[TITLE]
NUM-34: [GWF] DEEP flow = K on an aquifer below field capacity.
S1: wet aquifer (theta 0.45 > field capacity 0.30), no custom expression.
S2: dry aquifer (theta 0.20 < field capacity 0.30), DEEP = K.
S2's K(theta) = Ks exp(-(phi - theta) HCO) = 1.0 exp(-0.3 x 10) = 0.0498 in/hr,
so its deep percolation over 24 h is 1.195 in = 0.996 ac-ft on 10 ac.

[OPTIONS]
FLOW_UNITS           CFS
INFILTRATION         HORTON
FLOW_ROUTING         KINWAVE
START_DATE           06/01/2020
START_TIME           00:00:00
REPORT_START_DATE    06/01/2020
REPORT_START_TIME    00:00:00
END_DATE             06/02/2020
END_TIME             00:00:00
WET_STEP             00:05:00
DRY_STEP             01:00:00
REPORT_STEP          01:00:00
ROUTING_STEP         0:00:30
IGNORE_ROUTING       YES

[EVAPORATION]
CONSTANT         0.0

[RAINGAGES]
G1   INTENSITY 1:00 1.0 TIMESERIES R1

[SUBCATCHMENTS]
;;Name Gage Outlet Area %Imperv Width %Slope CurbLen
S1   G1   O1   10.0   0   500   1.0   0
S2   G1   O1   10.0   0   500   1.0   0

[SUBAREAS]
S1   0.01   0.1   0.05   0.05   0   OUTLET
S2   0.01   0.1   0.05   0.05   0   OUTLET

[INFILTRATION]
S1   3.0   0.5   4   7   0
S2   3.0   0.5   4   7   0

[AQUIFERS]
;;Name por  WP    FC    Ksat  Kslope Tslope ETu  ETs  Seep Ebot Egw Umc
AWET   0.5  0.15  0.30  5.0   10     15     0.35 14   0    0    6   0.45
ADRY   0.5  0.15  0.30  1.0   10     15     0.35 14   0    0    6   0.20

[GROUNDWATER]
;;Subcatch Aquifer Node Esurf A1 B1 A2 B2 A3 Dsw
S1   AWET   O1   10   0   0   0   0   0   0   *
S2   ADRY   O1   10   0   0   0   0   0   0   *

[GWF]
S2   DEEP   K

[OUTFALLS]
O1   0   FREE

[TIMESERIES]
;no rain
R1   06/01/2020 00:00   0.0

[REPORT]
SUBCATCHMENTS ALL
